Description: native GPU ebook reader
 Read EPUB, PDF, MOBI/AZW3, DOCX/ODT, DjVu and comic archives with a
 layout engine written from scratch: first-line indent, centred titles,
 per-run styles, inline and block images, CJK line breaking. No embedded
 browser, no WebView.
 .
 The binary is built from a private source repository; releases and their
 checksums live at https://github.com/panzhifu/folio-releases. Third-party
 licence texts ship in /usr/share/doc/folio.
